13:58Z", "body": "Release v2.0.1 - See [changelog](https://github.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/releases/tag/20001-2.0.1)", "assets": [{"name": "AutoExpandNotifications-2.0.1.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/io.github.kvmy666.autoexpand/releases/download/20001-2.0.1/AutoExpandNotifications-2.0.1.apk", "size": 90322470, "downloadCount": 54}]}, {"tagName": "20000-2.0.0", "name": "v2.0.0", "createdAt": "2026-04-03T05:05:34Z", "body": "Release v2.0.0 - See [changelog](https://github.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/releases/tag/20000-2.0.0)", "assets": [{"name": "AutoExpandNotifications-2.0.0.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/io.github.kvmy666.autoexpand/releases/download/20000-2.0.0/AutoExpandNotifications-2.0.0.apk", "size": 90321602, "downloadCount": 90}]}], "contributors": ["kvmy666"], "readme": "# Auto Expand\n\nA tool that improves how notifications behave.\n\n## Before and After\n\n![Before and after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/before-after.gif)\n\n## Supported devices\n\n| Company | System | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| OnePlus / OPPO / Realme | OxygenOS / ColorOS 16 | ✅ Tested on device |\n| Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO | HyperOS 3 | ✅ Verified against SystemUI |\n| vivo / iQOO | OriginOS 6 | ✅ Verified against SystemUI |\n| Honor | MagicOS | ✅ Verified against SystemUI |\n| Google / Motorola / Sony / Nothing | AOSP / Android 16 | ◐ Engine 2 tested on emulator |\n| Samsung | One UI | ⏳ Not yet |\n| ASUS | ZenUI / ROG | ⏳ Not yet |\n\n*Tested = run on the phone. Verified = checked against that company's real SystemUI files.*\n\n## Screenshots\n\n| Expanded Heads-Up | Notification Shade |\n|---|---|\n| ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/headsup-expanded.jpg) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/notification-shade.jpg) |\n\n## What's inside\n\n- Expands notifications in the shade and on the lock screen.\n- Expanded heads-up banners, with a line limit you choose.\n- Group handling and per-app exclusions.\n- An engine selector (Auto / Engine 1 / Engine 2) with a short built-in test procedure.\n\n## License\n\nGPL-3.0 — see [LICENSE](LICENSE).\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nThis module modifies SystemUI and Gboard through Xposed hooks. It's extensively tested, but use it at your own risk — keep a backup and have bootloop protection in place.\n", "readmeZh": "# 自动展开\n\n一种改进通知行为方式的工具。\n\n## 之前和之后\n\n![之前和之后](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/before-after.gif)\n\n## 支持的设备\n\n|公司 |系统|状态 |\n|---|---|---|\n| OnePlus / OPPO / Realme | OxygenOS / ColorOS 16 | ✅ 在设备上测试 |\n|小米/红米/POCO | HyperOS 3 | ✅ 根据 SystemUI 进行验证 |\n| vivo/iQOO| OriginOS 6 | ✅ 根据 SystemUI 进行验证 |\n|荣誉资质 | MagicOS | ✅ 根据 SystemUI 进行验证 |\n|谷歌/摩托罗拉/索尼/什么都没有| AOSP / Android 16 | ◐ 引擎 2 在模拟器上测试 |\n|三星|一个用户界面 | ⏳ 还没有 |\n|华硕| ZenUI/ROG| ⏳ 还没有 |\n\n*已测试 = 在手机上运行。已验证 = 对照该公司的真实 SystemUI 文件进行检查。*\n\n## 截图\n\n|扩展单挑 |通知栏 |\n|---|---|\n| ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/headsup-expanded.jpg) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kvmy666/-AutoExpandNotifications/main/screenshots/notification-shade.jpg) |\n\n## 里面有什么\n\n- 扩展阴影和锁定屏幕上的通知。\n- 扩展的平视横幅，具有您选择的行数限制。\n- 组处理和每个应用程序排除。\n- 带有简短内置测试程序的发动机选择器（自动/发动机 1/发动机 2）。\n\n## 许可证\n\nGPL-3.0 — 请参阅[许可证]（许可证）。\n\n## 免责声明\n\n该模块通过Xposed钩子修改SystemUI和Gboard。它经过了广泛的测试，但使用它需要您自担风险——保留备份并设置引导循环保护。"}